  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program Development Fund 2013-2014 - Demo, HR, Regional Strat.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utvecklings fonden 2013-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PDF ska anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r programstuderande f&#xf6;rberedelser och bed&#xf6;mningar, externa bed&#xf6;mningar, &#xf6;vervakning, utv&#xe4;rderingar, revision, policy     unders&#xf6;kningar och r&#xe5;d i form av konsultering. Syftet med fonden &#xe4;r   att &#xf6;ka kvaliteten p&#xe5; utvecklingssamarbetet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PDF is to be used for programme preparations and assessments,     external appraisals, monitoring, evaluations, audits, policy studies  and advises in the form of consultancies. The purpose of the fund is  to increase the quality of the development cooperation activities.</narrative>
  </description>
